        "original_id": "e900e840-41fe-5ecf-b78e-2ca18c681b10",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Duffell, Ken Hughes, James Mason, Robert Culp, Telly Savalas\n- Works: Inside Out, Chitty Chitty Bang Bang\n- Roles: film director, television director, screenwriter, writer, producer\n- Places: Canterbury, England\n\nFacts:\n- Ken Hughes was born on 19 January 1922 and became a British film director, writer, and producer.\n- Peter Duffell was born in 1937 in Canterbury, England, and became a British film and television director and screenwriter.\n- In 1968, Ken Hughes co-wrote and directed the children's film Chitty Chitty Bang Bang.\n- In 1975, the British action thriller film Inside Out was produced and directed by Peter Duffell.\n- Inside Out starred James Mason, Robert Culp, and Telly Savalas.\n- Ken Hughes died on 28 April 2001.",
